    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-It\u00b4s an Interactive <strong>Visual Novel</strong> that offers a large number of decisions </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">that will allow you to reach satisfactory endings unless you have chosen wrongly.-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WARNINGS: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- ADULT CONTENT.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- WORK IN PROGRESS: 70% FINISHED(from day 5, most of the content is in color sketches).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GENRE: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Date-Sim - Interactive Visual Novel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TAGS:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Gender-Bender</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Male protagonist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Small tits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Big tits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Sex</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Blowjob</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Romance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Mystery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Hardcore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PLOT:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your roommate and best friend tries to &quot;force&quot; Neus, the most introverted of the whole design school, who bites him just after you save her. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You discover that bite was not only for self-defense, it also contains a bewitching that turns your roomate step by step into a girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who everyday that pases, she seem forgeting more his past and becoming more attracted to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To save your friend, you make a pact wit Neus to have 3 dates, and the last night she promises to return his original male form to your buddy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Although it seems that she keeps her word, there are sinister things she had not told you yet.</p>",
